{"recordType":"poet-social-reader-pilot-release","schemaVersion":"1.0.0","releaseId":"poet-social-reader-pilot-20260820","reviewState":"published-event-evidence","notice":"此阅读试点仅重用已发布生平事件及其原典定位；图谱关系边仍按其自身的候选状态呈现，不因阅读导览而提升为已核定史实。","profiles":[{"personId":"bai-ju-yi","reviewState":"published-event-evidence","events":[{"id":"bai-ju-yi-hanlin-changan-02","title":"召入翰林为学士，拜左拾遗","summary":"元和二年十一月召入翰林为学士，三年五月拜左拾遗。本传未记确切任职地，按翰林学士与左拾遗皆在京师长安任职的语境定位为长安。","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"github-26-histories-jiu-tang-shu","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"卷一百六十六·列传第一百一十六.md","startLine":91,"endLine":91}},{"sourceId":"github-26-histories-xin-tang-shu","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"卷一百一十九·列传第四十四.md","startLine":41,"endLine":41}}],"reviewStatus":"published"},{"id":"bai-ju-yi-jiangzhou-exile-05","title":"贬为江州司马","summary":"元和十年七月因请捕贼雪国耻触怒执政，追诏授江州司马。江州治寻阳，即今九江一带，本传后文亦记自浔阳浮江上峡，故以寻阳定位。","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"github-26-histories-jiu-tang-shu","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"卷一百六十六·列传第一百一十六.md","startLine":119,"endLine":119}},{"sourceId":"github-26-histories-jiu-tang-shu","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"卷一百六十六·列传第一百一十六.md","startLine":161,"endLine":161}}],"reviewStatus":"published"},{"id":"bai-ju-yi-luoyang-death-15","title":"大中元年卒","summary":"会昌中以刑部尚书致仕，居洛阳香山，与僧如满结香火社，自称香山居士。大中元年卒于洛阳，时年七十六，本传载其卒年与终老之地。","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"github-26-histories-jiu-tang-shu","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"卷一百六十六·列传第一百一十六.md","startLine":183,"endLine":183}},{"sourceId":"github-26-histories-jiu-tang-shu","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"卷一百六十六·列传第一百一十六.md","startLine":185,"endLine":185}}],"reviewStatus":"published"}]},{"personId":"su-shi","reviewState":"published-event-evidence","events":[{"id":"su-shi-xining-hangzhou","title":"在钱塘任通判","summary":"苏轼请求外任后到杭州担任通判。年谱连续记下他在杭州任内的政务、出游和写作；这里既是早年仕途的重要一站，也构成《饮湖上初晴后雨》所写西湖景色的背景。","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_000.txt","startLine":1095,"endLine":1104}},{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_000.txt","startLine":1105,"endLine":1143}},{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_004.txt","startLine":282,"endLine":287}}],"reviewStatus":"published"},{"id":"su-shi-yuanfeng-huangzhou","title":"谪居黄州与东坡创作","summary":"苏轼于元丰三年二月到黄州，先寓居定惠院，后迁临皋亭。年谱记有他经营东坡、筑雪堂、自号东坡居士，以及壬戌秋冬两次游赤壁并作《赤壁赋》《后赤壁赋》的线索。","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_000.txt","startLine":1240,"endLine":1271}},{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_000.txt","startLine":1291,"endLine":1326}},{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_000.txt","startLine":1338,"endLine":1348}}],"reviewStatus":"published"},{"id":"su-shi-yuanfu-return-changzhou","title":"北归途中病卒常州","summary":"元符三年苏轼由儋州北归，经琼州、廉州等地；建中靖国元年到真州后病止常州，七月卒于此，年谱保留了归程与终点。常州也因此成为归程的终点与晚年停居地。","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_000.txt","startLine":1716,"endLine":1746}},{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_000.txt","startLine":1748,"endLine":1775}}],"reviewStatus":"published"}]}],"stories":[{"id":"reader-bai-ju-yi-yuan-zhen","anchorId":"bai-ju-yi","anchorName":"白居易","otherPersonId":"cbdb:32248","otherName":"元稹","edgeId":"net-bai-ju-yi-cbdb-32248","reviewState":"published-event-evidence","events":[{"id":"bai-ju-yi-jiangzhou-exile-05","title":"贬为江州司马","summary":"元和十年七月因请捕贼雪国耻触怒执政，追诏授江州司马。江州治寻阳，即今九江一带，本传后文亦记自浔阳浮江上峡，故以寻阳定位。","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"github-26-histories-jiu-tang-shu","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"卷一百六十六·列传第一百一十六.md","startLine":119,"endLine":119}},{"sourceId":"github-26-histories-jiu-tang-shu","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"卷一百六十六·列传第一百一十六.md","startLine":161,"endLine":161}}],"reviewStatus":"published"},{"id":"bai-ju-yi-yiling-stop-08","title":"停舟夷陵","summary":"元和十四年三月元稹会居易于峡口，停舟夷陵三日，与季弟行简同游。按本传明确记停舟地点为夷陵，即今湖北宜昌一带，本传未核定确切年份。","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"github-26-histories-jiu-tang-shu","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"卷一百六十六·列传第一百一十六.md","startLine":161,"endLine":161}}],"reviewStatus":"published"}]},{"id":"reader-su-shi-su-zhe","anchorId":"su-shi","anchorName":"苏轼","otherPersonId":"cbdb:1493","otherName":"苏辙","edgeId":"net-su-shi-cbdb-1493","reviewState":"published-event-evidence","events":[{"id":"su-shi-xining-mizhou","title":"由钱塘移守密州","summary":"苏轼在杭州任满后移守密州。年谱记有他到郡后处理灾伤、盐税等地方事务，也记下他在中秋写作《水调歌头》怀念弟弟苏辙；本次只发布已在同版本原文中逐句核对的作品摘录。","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_000.txt","startLine":1137,"endLine":1158}},{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_000.txt","startLine":1164,"endLine":1168}},{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_000.txt","startLine":1170,"endLine":1175}}],"reviewStatus":"published"},{"id":"su-shi-shaosheng-danzhou-exile","title":"渡海谪居儋州","summary":"绍圣四年苏轼由惠州与苏过渡海，途中在藤州会苏辙、雷州作别，七月抵儋州；元符三年获徙廉州，贬居与北归的转折由此展开。本站以儋州标记这段长期贬居的主要地点。","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_000.txt","startLine":1629,"endLine":1659}},{"sourceId":"kanripo-kr4d0076","locator":{"kind":"line-range","path":"KR4d0076_000.txt","startLine":1660,"endLine":1718}}],"reviewStatus":"published"}]}]}